					<description><![CDATA[The City of Benton Commissions Committee will meet August 11th, at 5:00 p.m. in the new City Hall Council Chambers at 410 River Street. This meeting&#8217;s agenda is as follows: City of Benton Commissions Committee Meeting Agenda August 11, 2026 5:00 P.M. Council Chambers &#160; Committee Members: Ann Spencer-Cole, Chair Judd Hart, Chair Public Utilities [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div id="attachment_51460" style="width: 287px" class="wp-caption aligncenter"><a href="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1-city-of-benton-logo.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-51460" class="wp-image-51460 " src="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1-city-of-benton-logo.jpg" alt="" width="277" height="228" srcset="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1-city-of-benton-logo.jpg 1024w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1-city-of-benton-logo-300x247.jpg 300w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1-city-of-benton-logo-750x617.jpg 750w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 277px) 100vw, 277px" /></a></p>
<p id="caption-attachment-51460" class="wp-caption-text"><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #ff6600;">To see the list of all events, visit <a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://www.mysaline.com">www.mysaline.com</a></span></p>
</div>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px;">The City of Benton Commissions Committee will meet August 11th, at 5:00 p.m. in the new City Hall Council Chambers at 410 River Street. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong>This meeting&#8217;s agenda is as follows:</strong></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>City of Benton</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>Commissions Committee</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>Meeting Agenda</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">August 11, 2026</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">5:00 P.M.</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Council Chambers</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Committee Members:</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Ann Spencer-Cole, Chair Judd Hart, Chair Public Utilities Commission</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Evelyn Reed, Vice Chair</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Staff Liaison: Jason Lyon, Director of Community Development</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   1. Establish a Quorum/Call to Order</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   2. Recognition of Attendees</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   3. Statement of FOIA Compliance</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">I affirm that I have not engaged in any prohibited discussion, deliberation, or</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">polling regarding any item on this meeting’s agenda outside of a properly</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">noticed and open meeting, in compliance with the Arkansas Freedom of</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Information Act, as amended by Act 505 of 2025.</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   4. Approval of Minutes of July 14<span class="s2">th</span></span><span style="font-size: 20px;">, 2026</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   5. Information from P&amp;Z (8/4/26 Meeting) – Council Member(s) Spencer–Cole </span><span style="font-size: 20px;">and Reed</span></p>
<p class="p3"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>     A.</b><b> </b><b>ORDINANCE NO. OF 2026</b></span></p>
<p class="p3"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>ORDINANCE TO ALLOW A CONDITIONAL USE PERMIT TO </b></span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>ALLOW A YOUTH HOME AT 2010 JACKMAN ST AND REPEAL </b></span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>ORDINANCE 02 OF 2026</b></span></p>
<p class="p3"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>     B.</b><b> </b><b>ORDINANCE NO. OF 2026</b></span></p>
<p class="p3"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>ORDINANCE TO REZONE PROPERTY AT 507 HWY 5 N FROM R2 </b></span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>TO C3</b></span></p>
<p class="p3"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>     C.</b><b> </b><b>P&amp;Z MEETING 8/4/26– Non-Council Item Information – Staff Comment</b></span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   6. Information from Public Utilities Commission – Council Member Hart</span></p>
<p class="p4"><span style="font-size: 20px;">      A. No Items</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   7. Advertising and Promotion Commission</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><span class="s4">      A.</span> <span class="s4">No Items</span></span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   8. Historic District Commission Review</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">      A. No items</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;">9. Adjournment</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 20px;"><strong>Previous Meeting Minutes</strong></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>PLANNING COMMISSION MEETING</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>Tuesday, August 4</b><span class="s1"><b>th</b></span></span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>, 2026</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>6:00 PM</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   1) Establish a Quorum/Call to Order</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   2) Statement of FOIA Compliance &amp; Roll Call</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><i>I affirm that I have not engaged in any prohibited discussion, deliberation, or polling regarding</i></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><i>any item on this meeting’s agenda outside of a properly noticed and open meeting, in</i></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><i>compliance with the Arkansas Freedom of Information Act, as amended by Act 505 of 2025.</i></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   3) Approve Minutes from July 7<span class="s1">th</span>, 2026 Planning Commission Meeting</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   4) Board of Adjustments</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     a. 513 Algood Street [Variance for North Side BSL] <span class="s3"><b>&#8212; DENIED</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     b. 2719 Salt Creek Rd [Variance for South BSL] <span class="s3"><b>&#8212; APPROVED</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   5) Planning Commission</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     a. 2409 Military Rd [Site Plan for Wholesale Electric] <span class="s3"><b>– APPROVED 7/0</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     b. 2010 Jackman Street [Conditional Use for Youth Home]<span class="s3"><b> – APPROVED 7/0</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     c. 2409/2411 W. South Street [Rezone from R2 to C3]<span class="s3"><b> – FAILED LACK OF</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p2"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b>MOTION</b></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     d. 3215 Frendall [Rezone from R2 to R5]<span class="s3"><b> – WITHDRAWN</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     e. 507 Highway 5 [Rezone from R2 to C3]<span class="s3"><b> – APPROVED 7/0</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     f. Kendall’s Corner [Preliminary Plat]<span class="s3"><b> – APPROVED 7/0</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">     g. Hoover Street [Final Plat]<span class="s3"><b> – APPROVED 7/0</b></span></span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">   6) Other Business</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Meeting Adjourned</span></p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="color: #ff6600; font-size: 20px;">Browse more events below or see the full list of events at </span><strong style="color: #ff6600; font-size: 20px;"><a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://www.mysaline.com/events">www.mysaline.com/events</a></strong><span style="color: #ff6600; font-size: 20px;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px;"></p>
